stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> reported: fault report / failed check / statutory due / AI warning
  reported --> triaged: manager sets priority & asset
  triaged --> dispatched: contractor sent SMS link
  dispatched --> scheduled: contractor books visit
  scheduled --> in_progress: contractor on site
  in_progress --> awaiting_parts
  awaiting_parts --> in_progress
  in_progress --> resolved: fix confirmed (photo)
  resolved --> closed: invoice matched & approved
  reported --> cancelled
  triaged --> cancelled
  closed --> [*]
  cancelled --> [*]
